<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21589" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαμψ-ῶνυξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠχος</span>,
			ὁ, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνυξ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with crooked talons</i>, of birds of prey, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰγυπιοὶ γαμψώνυχες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.428
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				22.302
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰωνοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					488
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰν γ. παρθένον</span>, of the
			Sphinx, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				1199
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. ἅρπη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					12.336
				</span></i>
			, etc.:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαμψ-ώνυχος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				563b20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				750a11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.727c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ γ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				6.7.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Protr.</u>
				21
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιθ́</span>: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαμψώνυχοι ἀστακοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epich.
					30
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ γ.</span>, of beasts of prey,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				517b1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				503a30
			</span></i>.</div>
